<Base title="Reading" description="Books and essays William Nisbett keeps coming back to.">
  <h1>Reading</h1>
  <p>Books and essays I keep coming back to, with a line on why. Newest additions at the top.</p>

  <ul>
    <li><em>An Elegant Puzzle</em>, Will Larson. The chapter on sizing teams I reread every quarter.</li>
    <li><em>Draft No. 4</em>, John McPhee. Use a dictionary, not a thesaurus.</li>
    <li><em>The Hundreds</em>, Lauren Berlant and Kathleen Stewart. Writing in the gaps between everything else.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
